            "body": "This PR has been automatically converted to **draft** because all PRs must start as drafts.\n\nWhen you are ready for review, click **Ready for Review** to begin the review process. This will:\n1. Add the oncall reviewer (optional reviewer)\n2. Add required review teams based on your changes\n\nSee the [contribution guide](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/main/docs/developer/submit.md) for more details.",
            "createdAt": "2026-04-19T05:39:05Z",
